## External Contributions

External human contributions are not yet accepted. When they open,
all contributors must sign a DCO or ICLA/CCLA (see `CONTRIBUTING.md`).
At that point, relicensing authority requires either:
- a CLA granting the maintainer broad relicense rights, or
- per-contribution author confirmation.
